f=\"#/wiki/Zevelon%20Duskbringer\">Zevelon Duskbringer</a> raid), <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Undead%20Cave\">Edron Undead Cave</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth%2FCastle\">Vengoth Castle</a> (and <a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth\">mountains</a> before door), <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Vampire%20Crypt\">Edron Vampire Crypt</a>. <small><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%2FSpawns\">Vampire/Spawns</a> </i> </span></small>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tVampires will retarget.<br/><br/>A vampire attacks in melee range. A vampire will retreat at 1 to 18 (0.21% - 3.79%, deep red) health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on March 04, 2025, the patch added a \"very rare\" chance of looting <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> from this creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 12,097 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=